  "details": "   * SECURITY UPDATE: DoS in mod_proxy_http2 via missing Host header\n     with ProxyPreserveHost\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2025-49630.patch: in open_stream() in\n       modules/http2/h2_proxy_session.c, when preserve_host is on and the\n       client request has no Host header, fall back to\n       r->server->server_hostname and add it to the request headers so a\n       NULL authority no longer trips an assertion in the h2 proxy path.\n       Backported from httpd commit 88304321841a2fe8bd5eacc70e69418b0b545ca5\n       (SVN r1927044, 2.4.x branch), plus adapted regression test from\n       SVN r1934478 (test/modules/http2/test_600_h2proxy.py).\n     - CVE-2025-49630",
